    external sources remain the property of their publishers and are
    linked, not reproduced, wherever the source is publicly available.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to keep content correct — see the
    <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> and
    <a href="/corrections/">corrections policy</a> — but content is
    provided as-is. Always verify exam-critical details against your
